<section class="section faq-section"><p class="eyebrow dark">A LITTLE CLARITY</p><h2>Before you join us.</h2><div class="faq-grid"><details><summary>Can I register a group?</summary><p>Yes. Choose Group / Multiple and add each delegate. The total is calculated per delegate, and tickets are issued individually after payment is confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>I have already paid by bank transfer. What should I do?</summary><p>Choose Yes, I have already paid. Add each delegate's TAA Delegate ID and upload the bank receipt as an image or PDF. The payment and IDs remain under review until TAA confirms them.</p></details><details><summary>How can I pay if I have not paid yet?</summary><p>Choose Secure Online Payment, Bank Transfer, or Cash at Venue. For a new bank transfer, transfer the displayed total and attach your receipt. Cash registrations stay pending until payment is collected at the venue.</p></details><details><summary>When will I receive my ticket?</summary><p>Tickets are issued after payment is confirmed. Bank transfers and previously paid registrations are checked by the TAA finance team first.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to print my ticket?</summary><p>No. Save your digital ticket on your phone and show its QR code to the registrar when you arrive.</p></details><details><summary>What if my payment is still pending?</summary><p>Keep your secure registration link and check the status there. Do not pay again while a transfer or online payment is being checked. Contact the registration team if you need help.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share my ticket?</summary><p>Each ticket belongs to its named delegate. Keep its link private and do not forward or reuse its QR code.</p></details></div></section>
